        "heading": "Who are the biggest federal buyers in New York this fiscal year?",
        "body": "The Department of Veterans Affairs obligated $185M in FY2027 to date. The Department of Energy obligated $154M, and the General Services Administration obligated $43.5M. The Department of Justice and the Department of Health and Human Services obligated $19.9M and $14.2M respectively."
      },
      {
        "heading": "Which vendors and industries collected the most obligations in New York?",
        "body": "BROOKHAVEN SCIENCE ASSOCIATES LLC received $154M in FY2027 to date. WELCH ALLYN, INC. and BOOZ ALLEN HAMILTON INC collected $31.1M and $21.1M respectively. Research and Development in the Physical, Engineering, and Life Sciences (except Biotechnology) is the top industry with $154M, followed by Surgical and Medical Instrument Manufacturing at $34.9M."
      }
